*m: CODE:TRACE V 5.0 Patch 9
*
* VAL-005 Phase 1: S/RV blowdown benchmark, dry system (no loop seal).
* Reference: EGG-EAST-9232 (R5FORCE/MOD3s), Section 5 sample problem.
* See VAL_005_build_spec.md for geometry provenance and targets.
*
* Layout (flow order):
*   10 BREAK  supply pressure boundary, table: 16.55 MPa -> 18.27 MPa over 0.5 s
*   20 VALVE  supply/accumulator isolation, trip-closed at t = 1.0 s
*   30 PIPE   accumulator, 2.83 m3
*   40 PIPE   inlet line + loop seal (dry: steam), 9 cells
*   50 VALVE  relief valve: opens 40 ms at 17.24 MPa, recloses at 16.38 MPa
*   60 PIPE   discharge: riser, header, long run, down leg, tail; 17 cells
*   70 BREAK  atmosphere
*
